5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if other places have better bins! Let's look at the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about the money. I'll check the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We should see why people are unhappy. I'll look at the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I don't want us wasting hours on this. I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Fairness is key. I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
