30,2,1,talk,Rin,,The other bin house smells really bad in summer! And the supervised mornings take almost an hour every time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Shelters are expensive, over two hundred thousand yen! Even with a subsidy, it's a lot. Plus, we already spend thousands on nets and deodorants.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Most complaints come from the person whose gate the bins are at. Also, the station block started fighting over who sweeps the bin house.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,The truck comes so early that some of us would have to be awake and waiting before dawn to supervise.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Not all our frontages are the same size; some are too narrow. Also, changing the location requires a formal notice every single time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If it smells and takes a long time, maybe we shouldn't do those things.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Midori,,I really think we should avoid a big construction project. The cost would be a huge burden for some of us.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we pick something that causes more arguments, like cleaning duties, we'll never get along again.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,Spending an hour every turn is too much. We need something that doesn't eat up our free time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"Moving the bins seems like a bureaucratic nightmare with the ward office, and some houses simply can't fit them.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,I just want it to be clean and not smelly!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Midori,,Is there any way to keep it cheap but still solve the problem?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,We need a solution that doesn't put all the pressure on one person or create new chores.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,"Exactly. If it's a ""rotating"" job, someone always ends up doing the heavy lifting.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"We must acknowledge that the current location is unfair to one neighbor, but the alternatives have physical limits.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
