55,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A sounds like a lot of waiting. Option B moves the smell. Option C might smell worse inside!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is way too expensive. Option A and B are free, but B seems more complicated with the ward.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A requires us to police each other, which sounds like a recipe for more fighting. Option B is fairer.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is a time sink. Option B is just moving a spot. Option C is a one-time build, but who manages it?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B is difficult because of the frontage widths and the filing requirements. Option A keeps it in one place.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,I don't like the idea of standing there in the morning. I vote for B!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I can't support C. Between A and B, B doesn't cost us any money. I'll go with B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,B distributes the burden. It's the only way to stop the complaints from the one household. I vote B.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,"I hate the idea of ""supervised hours."" B is better because you just put the bins out. I vote B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"B is a hassle for the ward, but A is a hassle for the people. I'll vote A to avoid the filing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
